### 3. **Progress Bar / Animation (TotpProgressBar)**

**File:** `/Volumes/Dumpy/Research/automated_program_repair_for_ui_bugs/runs/claude_original_run1/bug-271/app/src/main/java/com/beemdevelopment/aegis/ui/views/TotpProgressBar.java`

